  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.header": "熔岩竅之用",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.text_1": "尋竅中央所露之核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.text_2": "清核四周，勿損其核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.text_3": "以爆炸啟其核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.text_4": "置熔岩源於作核之側。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.text_5": "採其石，復添熔岩源。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_activation.text_6": "碎竅生之石以取物，所出詳見JEI。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_automation.header": "熔岩竅自動之法",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_automation.text_1": "作核之側，留一格空。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_automation.text_2": "凡熔岩供應皆可，此例用滴石與釜。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_automation.text_3": "以泵送熔岩至核側之空格。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_automation.text_4": "轉鑽取其所生之石。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.molten_vent_automation.text_5": "收鑽下之石，而後加工。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.header": "泉竅",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.text_1": "尋竅中央所露之核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.text_2": "清核四周，勿損其核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.text_3": "以爆炸啟其核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.text_4": "置水源於作核之側。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.text_5": "採其石，復添水源。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_activation.text_6": "Mill impure stone for a small chance of resources.",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_automation.header": "泉竅·Create",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_automation.text_1": "作核之側，留一格空。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_automation.text_2": "A 2x2 infinite water pool supplies this pump.",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_automation.text_3": "Pump water from the infinite pool into the space beside the core.",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_automation.text_4": "轉鑽取其所生之石。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.water_vent_automation.text_5": "收鑽下之石，而後加工。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.header": "極熱竅",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.text_1": "尋竅中央所露之核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.text_2": "清核四周，勿損其核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.text_3": "以爆炸啟其核。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.text_4": "置極熱熔岩源於作核之側。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.text_5": "採純石，復添極熱熔岩源。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_activation.text_6": "碎純石以多得碎礦與粒，非增礦石。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_automation.header": "極熱竅·Create",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_automation.text_1": "作核之側，留一格空。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_automation.text_2": "Power a Mechanical Press over a Basin to make superheated lava.",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_automation.text_3": "1000 mB lava + a Blaze Cake + obsidian dust makes 500 mB superheated lava. Press twice per bucket.",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_automation.text_4": "以泵送極熱熔岩至核側之空格。",
  "create_water_vents.ponder.superheated_vent_automation.text_5": "轉鑽取其所生之石。",
